     *
     * <p>This method protects against directory‑traversal attacks by normalizing
     * the supplied {@code name} and ensuring that the resolved path stays
     * within {@code dir}. It also guarantees that the returned file does not
     * already exist by appending a numeric suffix if necessary.</p>
     *
